            "testimonial_text": "I watched a lot of product videos and thought it was worth a try. Ive been using it for over 6 months and my skin has definitely improved. My complexion is clearer and my skin tone is much more even.",
            "author_name": "Marcie Knowles",
            "author_location": "New York"
          }
        }
      ]
